 "_readme": [
  "ScholarPath programme catalogue — evidence-only.",
  "Every value here must be traceable to the university's own page (or the DAAD entry)",
  "and the source is recorded in `source`. Anything not verified is null, and null means",
  "UNKNOWN — the engine will return Check manually rather than treat it as 'no requirement'.",
  "Nothing in this file may be invented to make a demo look better. If you cannot verify a",
  "number, leave it null and let the result say so.",
  "Fields: level, teachingLanguages, acceptedFields (or anyField), subjectEcts, bachelorEctsRequired,",
  "minGpaGerman, ieltsReq, toeflReq, englishOther (moi_accepted|moi_rejected|other), englishOtherText,",
  "germanReq {level,test}, otherRequirements {gre{quant,verbal,aw}, gate, testas, sat, act,",
  "workExperienceMonths, motivationLetter, references}, tuitionPerSemester, semesterContribution,",
  "intake/intakes, deadlineNonEu, state, city, links.",
  "Verified 2026-10-24 against the pages in `source`.",
  "Scholarships follow the same rule: null = unverified. `fields: []` records a call that",
  "is explicitly open to all disciplines; `germanReq: false` a call that requires no German",
  "certificate; `ieltsReq: false` one that requires no IELTS. Unset means Check manually."
